            "location": "Charlotte, US · Grippy Water Shoes",
            "rating": 5
          }
        },
        "text3": {
          "type": "text_review",
          "settings": {
            "title": "",
            "body": "I live in a warm climate and run on the beach every morning. I used to go barefoot till I saw these. Now I have a protective barrier between my feet and hazards on the sand, like shells. My favorite water shoe.",
